Third-party material bundled with OpenPiano (keeps its own license):

- sounds/piano.js: acoustic grand piano samples from the FluidR3 GM soundfont
  by Frank Wen, converted by https://github.com/gleitz/midi-js-soundfonts.
  Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
- js/staff.js: treble and bass clef outlines from the Bravura music font by
  Steinberg Media Technologies. SIL Open Font License 1.1 —
  https://github.com/steinbergmedia/bravura
